Disposal: `unload()` should remove everything, dispose geometries/materials/textures that aren't in `this.textures`, and dispose env render targets. Traverse `this.scene` children (except camera) and dispose. But `this.textures` are referenced by materials; material.dispose won't dispose textures, so fine.

