Now CSS append. Need to see end of styles.css (line 2 is media query maybe and more). Just append rules.

Rules:
```css
.hero-canvas{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block;z-index:0;opacity:0;transition:opacity .7s ease;cursor:grab;touch-action:pan-y}
.hero-canvas.dragging{cursor:grabbing}
.hero-art.live .hero-canvas{opacity:1}
.hero-art.live .art-car,.hero-art.live .art-sun,.hero-art.live .art-track,.hero-art.live .art-lines{opacity:0;transition:opacity .5s}
.hero-art.live{background:#7d8f93}
.hero-art.live:before{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#11151055,transparent 62%),linear-gradient(0deg,#13181277,transparent 46%)}
```
Careful `.hero-art:before` z-index 1, canvas 0, art-year 2 → year/stamp/caption above. Good.

Also the `.art-car` etc have no transition originally; adding is fine.

Hmm `.hero-art` overflow hidden.

Also mobile `.hero-art{height:265px}`.

Add to end.

